<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>The DQ Peanut Buster Parfait — A Classic Since 1968</h2>
  <p>Few items on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> have the longevity of the Peanut Buster® Parfait. Introduced in 1968, it has remained virtually unchanged for over 55 years: alternating layers of DQ soft serve, salted roasted peanuts, and hot fudge sauce in a parfait cup. The formula works because it hits the salty-sweet contrast perfectly — the cold, smooth soft serve against warm fudge and crunchy salted peanuts creates a textural experience that is more interesting than most frozen desserts twice its price.</p>
  <h2>What's in the Peanut Buster Parfait?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>DQ soft serve</strong> — The same smooth vanilla soft serve base used across all DQ treats</li>
    <li><strong>Salted roasted peanuts</strong> — Adds crunch, salt, and protein. The peanuts are the defining element.</li>
    <li><strong>Hot fudge sauce</strong> — Warm, poured generously, creates a temperature contrast with the cold soft serve</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The parfait is served in a tall cup with alternating layers — fudge, soft serve, peanuts, fudge, soft serve, peanuts — so every spoonful has all three elements.</p>
