    <h2>Peanut Buster Parfait vs. Blizzard — Which Is More Value?</h2>
    <p>At $4.99 the Parfait is more expensive than a Mini or Small Blizzard. However, the Parfait is not blended — the layers are preserved, giving you distinct flavor zones in each spoonful depending on where you dip your spoon. A <a href="/items/reeses-blizzard">Reese's Small Blizzard</a> ($4.49) is similarly peanut-butter-forward but fully blended. The Parfait is the right choice when you want the layered experience; the Blizzard when you want even distribution.</p>
